# Google Maps Platform API Key (Client-side Maps JavaScript API, Places API New, Routes API)
# NEVER commit your real API key or .env.local to version control.
#
# Quickstart (Free Maps Demo Key - zero billing setup required for prototyping):
# 1. Visit https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
# 3. Click to generate/reveal your Maps Demo Key.
# 4. Copy this file to .env.local and replace the placeholder below with your key:
#      cp .env.example .env.local
#
# For production, create a dedicated key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API
# Restrict your key by HTTP referrer and APIs:
# https://docs.cloud.google.com/api-keys/docs/add-restrictions-api-keys?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0

VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
